    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d219">

                <pb facs="0375" n="243" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg243"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 P. W./7–1545: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 219 <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d219-f1"/></seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-15T18:00:00+01:00">July 15, 1945—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7146. We were called to FonOff this afternoon by Harvey who was considerably
                    disturbed about Department’s proposed announcement July 17 re Italy and World
                    Security Organization. …<anchor n="2" xml:id="d219-f2"/> British Embassy
                    Washington is being instructed to approach Department and request announcement
                    be postponed until the question of future status of Italy can be discussed at
                    Big Three meeting.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
